<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>Pink Lemonade (Str8 Reload)</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">LeoStayTrill</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2">Str8 Reload</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">Pink Lemonade (Str8 Reload)</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">4Pt80KvnL6e8DCd9QVx7Ht</ttm:item>
      <itunes:duration>02:02.200</itunes:duration>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:11.830" end="00:13.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Xeretto, fuck you doin' man?)</p>
      <p begin="00:13.990" end="00:17.050" ttm:agent="v1">Firm no Ls, I'm takin' dubs, come like Jonathan Shalit, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:17.050" end="00:20.560" ttm:agent="v1">You look good natural, fuck all that makeup, baby, close that palette</p>
      <p begin="00:20.560" end="00:23.410" ttm:agent="v1">Slide 'round here, I'm all in her ear, &quot;Bae, let me work my magic&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:23.410" end="00:25.590" ttm:agent="v1">Yo, the same lil' boys that's claiming they're rich</p>
      <p begin="00:25.590" end="00:27.170" ttm:agent="v1">They walk in the shop and don't cause no damage</p>
      <p begin="00:27.170" end="00:30.590" ttm:agent="v1">Adi done hit me, say I don't miss, come like all of my shots on target</p>
      <p begin="00:30.590" end="00:32.310" ttm:agent="v1">We're in no contact 'cause I been workin'</p>
      <p begin="00:32.310" end="00:34.200" ttm:agent="v1">Her and her friends keep sayin' I'm heartless</p>
      <p begin="00:34.200" end="00:37.430" ttm:agent="v1">Told her, &quot;Bae, I'm an artist,&quot; I walk in and my pockets the largest</p>
      <p begin="00:37.430" end="00:39.400" ttm:agent="v1">And she saw that I roll with a clique full of members</p>
      <p begin="00:39.400" end="00:40.900" ttm:agent="v1">Shocked her, she yellin' out, &quot;Rahted&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:40.660" end="00:42.930" ttm:agent="v1">Girl try say that I'm so conceited, full of myself</p>
      <p begin="00:42.930" end="00:44.430" ttm:agent="v1">What, you think I don't know that?</p>
      <p begin="00:43.840" end="00:45.350" ttm:agent="v1">Do my lil' dance with a grill in my mouth</p>
      <p begin="00:45.350" end="00:47.210" ttm:agent="v1">Grinnin' my teeth like I'm doin' up Kodak</p>
      <p begin="00:47.210" end="00:49.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Met a few snakes and I really can't go back (no way)</p>
      <p begin="00:49.110" end="00:50.640" ttm:agent="v1">All day I don't sleep, take no naps</p>
      <p begin="00:50.640" end="00:52.200" ttm:agent="v1">Shorty, come try spinnin' the block</p>
      <p begin="00:52.200" end="00:53.840" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck all the memories, this ain't a throwback</p>
      <p begin="00:53.840" end="00:56.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Income multiple ways (what) and my bro sip pink lemonade (ah yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:56.730" end="00:58.230" ttm:agent="v1">The bad B callin' me, &quot;Baby&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:58.070" end="00:59.570" ttm:agent="v1">And callin' me, &quot;My man&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:58.810" end="01:00.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Said I got multiple names (ah yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:00.140" end="01:02.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">The Merc' keep swervin', multiple lanes (skrt)</p>
      <p begin="01:02.020" end="01:03.520" ttm:agent="v1">I make coin on multiple days</p>
      <p begin="01:03.340" end="01:05.110" ttm:agent="v1">Don't chase, but I might do more for the cake</p>
      <p begin="01:05.110" end="01:07.040" ttm:agent="v1">Babe, if you're on what I'm on, set pace</p>
      <p begin="01:07.040" end="01:08.540" ttm:agent="v1">This yardie's tellin' me, &quot;Dance&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:08.380" end="01:10.110" ttm:agent="v1">Shit, I should've just flung my shoulder</p>
      <p begin="01:10.110" end="01:13.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">079 me, hand it over, whole team ballers, Guardiola (ah yeah, ah yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:13.380" end="01:14.980" ttm:agent="v1">Chain too cold, could've caught pneumonia</p>
      <p begin="01:14.980" end="01:16.760" ttm:agent="v1">Put it on when I link Adeola</p>
      <p begin="01:16.760" end="01:18.350" ttm:agent="v1">See me, I don't tolerate snakes</p>
      <p begin="01:18.350" end="01:20.290" ttm:agent="v1">Don't tolerate fakes so I cut the cobras</p>
      <p begin="01:20.290" end="01:21.850" ttm:agent="v1">Why the girl move booky?</p>
      <p begin="01:21.850" end="01:23.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Textin' my phone, &quot;Hey, Pookie&quot; (what?)</p>
      <p begin="01:23.120" end="01:25.090" ttm:agent="v1">Ha-ha-ha, hear dookie</p>
      <p begin="01:25.090" end="01:26.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ain't heard of your ex, like, &quot;Who's he?&quot; (Ah yeah, ah yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:26.560" end="01:28.130" ttm:agent="v1">Post my flicks on the net, no movie</p>
      <p begin="01:28.130" end="01:30.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Two-man step on the brown in two-piece (slide on the-)</p>
      <p begin="01:30.020" end="01:31.520" ttm:agent="v1">Slide on the baddie like Toosie</p>
      <p begin="01:31.350" end="01:33.480" ttm:agent="v1">Still cut 'em off like a fade, no Boosie, bitch</p>
      <p begin="01:33.480" end="01:36.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I-I-Income multiple ways and my bro sip pink lemonade (ah yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:36.640" end="01:38.140" ttm:agent="v1">The bad B callin' me, &quot;Baby&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:37.990" end="01:39.490" ttm:agent="v1">And callin' me, &quot;My man&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:38.750" end="01:40.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Said I got multiple names (ah yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:40.140" end="01:41.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">The Merc' keep swervin', multiple lanes (skrt)</p>
      <p begin="01:41.990" end="01:43.490" ttm:agent="v1">I make coin on multiple days</p>
      <p begin="01:43.290" end="01:45.150" ttm:agent="v1">Don't chase, but I might do more for the cake</p>
      <p begin="01:45.150" end="01:46.950" ttm:agent="v1">Babe, if you're on what I'm on, set pace</p>
      <p begin="01:46.950" end="01:48.520" ttm:agent="v1">This yardie's tellin' me, &quot;Dance&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:48.520" end="01:50.140" ttm:agent="v1">Shit, I should've just flung my shoulder</p>
      <p begin="01:50.140" end="01:53.660" ttm:agent="v1">079 me, hand it over, whole team ballers, Guardio-, Guardio-</p>
      <p begin="01:53.660" end="01:55.260" ttm:agent="v1">Chain too cold, could've caught pneumo-, caught pneumo-</p>
      <p begin="01:55.260" end="01:56.760" ttm:agent="v1">Put it on when I link Ad-Ad-, when I link</p>
      <p begin="01:56.550" end="01:58.400" ttm:agent="v1">See me, I-, see me, I don't tolerate snakes</p>
      <p begin="01:58.400" end="02:00.860" ttm:agent="v1">Don't tolerate fakes so I cut the cobras</p>
      <p begin="02:00.860" end="02:04.860" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
  </body>
